<!--Post: 108--><!--Time: 1085697773-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST108"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 27, 2004 - 3:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Michael Kelleher has a message to BTK that I&#39;ve just posted on the <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/news.html"> <b>news</b></a> page.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 108-->
<!--Post: 117--><!--Time: 1085781953-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST117"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Doone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Doone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, May 28, 2004 - 3:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I enjoyed M Kelleher&#39;s letter to BTK.  Unfortunately I don&#39;t think it&#39;ll get a response.  BTK has a local connection, I think there is a better possibility that he would respond on a local level.  Whatever caused the aging killer to dive back into the spotlight, I think he is in  this for good.  You wanna play you gotta pay.  Whether BTK is sick, tired or just bored, he wants us to give him the sickening credit he feels is his due. OK we&#39;re all atwitter, tell us your tale Mr BTK.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 117-->
<!--Post: 129--><!--Time: 1085841231-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST129"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 29, 2004 - 7:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great letter Mike, If the btk wants attention this would be the place get it. It has more hits than any other message board,and Tom won&#39;t hold anything back you can bet on that!Now lets see if the btk is truly a coward or not. My bet is he is.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 129-->
<!--Post: 146--><!--Time: 1085969175-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST146"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Armchair_sleuth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Armchair_sleuth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, May 30, 2004 - 7:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hopefully this letter will help rope this monster in. If BTK &#40; Backboneless Testiclefree Killer &#41; has the gumption to respond to Mike&#39;s message I&#39;ll be surprised. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 146-->
<!--Post: 327--><!--Time: 1088092144-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST327"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, June 24, 2004 - 8:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK, be a man. It is time to stand up and admit your responsibility, to turn yourself in. Thousands of reporters, from all around the world, will be calling to ask if they can interview you. Choose anyone you want. The people have questions that only you can answer. Turn yourself in and start telling it like it is. Set the record straight. Now, before it is too late. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
